# --- Forms -------------------------------------------------------------------
# The site is exported as static HTML, so there is no server to receive a
# submission. Both forms POST straight from the browser to this URL.
# Use something built to accept posts from a web page — Formspree, a Google
# Apps Script web app, a Zapier/Make catch hook. It is visible in the page
# source, so never put a secret or a privileged endpoint here.
# Leave empty and the form tells the visitor to call or email instead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=""
